  "content": "\n\n# DBTools - denni5x 为 Axiom 制作的模组\n\n## 功能特性\n\nDBTools 是一款专为 Axiom 设计的模组，提供了多种工具来优化建造体验。它内置了丰富的实用工具，详情请参阅文档了解具体功能。\n\n## 支持与联系\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n[<img alt=\"discord-plural\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\">](https://discord.com/invite/ZfVP5RmQzb)\n[<img alt=\"gitbook\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/documentation/gitbook_vector.svg\">](https://dennisbuilds.gitbook.io/dbtools/)\n[<img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\">](https://modrinth.com/mod/dbtools)\n[<img alt=\"twitter-plural\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/social/twitter-plural_vector.svg\">](https://x.com/dennisbuilds)\n[<img alt=\"youtube-plural\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\">](https://www.youtube.com/@dennisbuilds)\n[<img alt=\"patreon-plural\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-plural_vector.svg\">](https://www.patreon.com/dennisbuilds)\n\n</div>",
